    "<div style=\"left:0px;top:28px;width:519.15625px;height:14px;font:normal 300 12px Ubuntu, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;color:rgba(141,153,174,1);\">",
    "<div style=\"left:0.453125px;top:0px;height:14px;line-height:14px;\">",
    "resizes it from its nearest edge or corner, or moves the split nearest the pointer in a docked pane. </div>",
